ck.io/facebook/video/02feff889bbf75dd59d44eb3acc03a6fd73c86953f76003273b3f02931b15d5c.mp4\nThumbnail URL: https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/cf1c10d50bf52067924cfe5b4323f8acc860fb0e57f53d729a1113b4c0cc6b76.jpg\n\n## 4. Landing page\n\nhttps://nutri-paw.com/products/pre-probiotic-digestive-treats _(domain: nutri-paw.com)_\n\n## 5. Performance signals\n\nReach: 977,480\nEstimated spend: €8,797\nAdvertiser reach (30d): 3,865,378\nLaunched: 2026-08-26\nStill live: Yes (15 days running)\nRank trajectory: improving\n\n## 6. Verdict\n\n**Scaling hard — worth modeling.**\n\n---\nCredits used: 3 | Remaining: 7416 | Source: recurring\nBreakdown: ad_detail:1(success), reach_history:1(success)"
